  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you try to run a custom trigger that is on a disabled object, you will get NullReferenceException. \n\nIt does work on live.\n\nExample scene; https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/449386885299830794/480172900804984833/run-custrom-trigger-on-disabled-object.unity\n\nhttps://gist.github.com/PhaxeNor/d0e56d90250486559590e40cbced7a3a\n\n\nTo recreate;\n\nAdd a game object, set it to be disabled and add a VRC_Trigger that has a custom trigger.\n\nThen have a OnInteract call that custom trigger.\n\nThis will give you the error.\n\nIn the image example. The \"ThisWillBeEnabled\" is never enabled because the code stops on the OnInteract",
